<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound avg o/n rise, weekly rates fall.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound avg o/n rise, weekly rates fall.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average overnight rates on the Egyptian pound rose in a liquid private sector market on Tuesday to between 8-3/4 and 9-3/8 percent from 8-1/2 and 9-7/16 percent on Monday, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates fell to 8-3/4 and 9-3/8 percent versus nine to 8-7/8 and 9-1/2 percent on Monday.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1 ceh es</p>
</text>
